    Renderer : ScreenGui instances (no Drawing API needed, works on any executor)
    GUI      : Removed (headless/script-only version, RightShift toggles ESP)

    VISUALS  : full or corner boxes, translucent gradient fill, pulsing glow,
               names, health bar (smoothed) + number, distance, held tool,
               tracers, skeleton, head dot, look-direction line, chams
    THEMES   : Ice (default), Rainbow, Aurora, Sunset, Ocean, Neon, Fire, Toxic,
